# dsk-video-start.pdl - presentation video, part 2 (2026-11-09): on the SETUP screen (after dsk-video-new.pdl and setup_reset) choose speed fast, you play p1, press START GAME; pictures of each step go to /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw (the video folder is made from OPENED pictures only).
